   819.234\nInput data n2:          122381.898\nInput data n3:            1718.979\nThe numbers, in ascending order, are:\n             819.234            1718.979          122381.898\n"},"children":[],"key":"LmANldBszV"}],"key":"QiNFkxzkSi"}],"key":"FOLr2d8q9s"}],"key":"I2MvVLRvyj"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"Section 2.1: Associate Construct","url":"/sections/computer-programming/fortran/guide-to-fortran-2008-programming/section-2-1-statement-blocks","group":"Computer Programming"},"next":{"title":"Section 3.6: Median of Three","url":"/sections/computer-programming/fortran/guide-to-fortran-2008-programming/section-3-6-ex-1-median-of-three","group":"Computer Programming"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}